    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, just tightness when I'm anxious. Nothing otherwise.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:15",
      "end_timestamp": "03:20",
      "supports": [
        "review_of_systems[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Right. I'd say this is a flare of your anxiety, on top of a big life change, with sleep suffering.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:23",
      "end_timestamp": "03:33",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "It usually settles with the right help. I'd like to arrange a blood test, to rule out something physical like your thyroid, and check your vitamin levels.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:39",
      "end_timestamp": "03:54",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And I'd like you to try a sleep routine, no screens an hour before bed, a notepad by your bed to write the worries down, and keep caffeine before noon.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:58",
      "end_timestamp": "04:16",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'm also going to refer you for talking therapy, cognitive behavioural therapy, which is very effective.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:23",
      "end_timestamp": "04:31",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "A few weeks. In the meantime, there are breathing exercises on the practice website.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:38",
      "end_timestamp": "04:46",
